      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 25 · AI Upsell Recommender\nAnalyses a customer usage/purchase profile and recommends the best upsell or cross-sell with a tailored pitch.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/upsell-recommender` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"customer\": \"Globex\",\n \"email\": \"admin@globex.com\",\n \"plan\": \"Pro\",\n \"seats_used\": 48,\n \"seats_total\": 50,\n \"features_used\": [\n  \"reports\",\n  \"api\"\n ],\n \"months_active\": 14\n}\n```"
      }
    }
